  run 1  11.5 s wall  4.9 s syspolicyd CPU  rejected (the code is valid but does not seem to be an app)
  run 2   2.7 s wall  2.6 s syspolicyd CPU  same verdict
  run 3   2.6 s wall  2.5 s syspolicyd CPU  same verdict
The same verdicts come back for /.vol/<device>/<inode> as for the path, for both the Developer ID codex
and an ad-hoc signed CLI ("rejected" / "source=no usable signature").

